DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13390::$$$message_0109_0000_0000$$$::It became a late lunch.[lr]::
13391::$$$message_0109_0000_0001$$$::I soothe my screaming stomach and go back to the park holding my lunch.::
13392::$$$message_0109_0001_0000$$$::The park on a fine autumn day is thriving just like a weekend would be.[lr]::
13393::$$$message_0109_0001_0001$$$::The installed benches are mostly taken. I look for a place where I can sit and walk along the river in the park.::
13394::$$$message_0109_0002_0000$$$::An autumn breeze that smells like salt blows from the river mouth. It starts to feel even cooler.[lr]::
13395::$$$message_0109_0002_0001$$$::The clear blue sky and sunlight make me forget that right away. It's a really refreshing weekend.::
13396::$$$message_0109_0003_0000$$$::On the other side of the line of bright yellow gingko trees that shimmer as they waver[line len=3][lr]::
13397::$$$message_0109_0003_0001$$$::I can hear the cheers of children and the sound of a bouncing ball.::
13398::$$$message_0109_0004_0000$$$::Soccer. I wonder if they're playing soccer for fun.[lr]::
13399::$$$message_0109_0004_0001$$$::I did it. I did do it. To keep Shinji company.[lr]::
13400::$$$message_0109_0004_0002$$$::We did it on a day when it snowed for once... That time, Shinji lost one shoe... Well, that's fine.::
13401::$$$message_0109_0005_0000$$$::I find a sunny spot on the side of the field and sit cross-legged. The outline of my stomach is starting to become visible. It should be like a soccer ball that is out of air.[lr]::
13402::$$$message_0109_0005_0001$$$::I take the double layered lunch box out of the bag, and I stuff myself intently.::
13403::$$$message_0109_0006_0000$$$::After getting settled, I look up as I'm chewing. On the field are eight children fighting for the ball in teams of four against four.::
13404::$$$message_0109_0007_0000$$$::I watch the game while chewing boiled burdock.[lr]::
13405::$$$message_0109_0007_0001$$$::I was watching thinking that this was child's play, but on the contrary, their movements are quite nimble.[lr]::
13406::$$$message_0109_0007_0002$$$::It seems like each one of them are aware of their assigned roles of attack and defense. It's atypical for their number of players, but this is more like an amateur game than for fun.::
13407::$$$message_0109_0008_0000$$$::As I'm spectating, two of them clearly have different movements and are making clean passes. It seems like they are taking it a bit easy on the other kids. They must belong to their local soccer team.::
13408::$$$message_0109_0009_0000$$$::...As I'm thinking that, there are some energetic ones that charge towards the ball just with force. They get dodged effortlessly with feints and fall forward many times.[lr]::
13409::$$$message_0109_0009_0001$$$::But the way that they don't give up even then is endearing and makes me want to cheer them on a little. I'm not the only one who thinks that.::
13410::$$$message_0109_0010_0000$$$::There's someone in jeans who's raising their voice and cheering them on from diagonally across the field.[lr]::
13411::$$$message_0109_0010_0001$$$::That is not like any cheering that I'm used to, but like a sports broadcast where they're voicing every reaction. The kids are also getting distracted every time they raise their voice and look awkward.::
13412::$$$message_0109_0011_0000$$$::They're not Japanese. Their hair is a beautiful shade of blond that's different from dyed hair. They are pale and skinny like a girl[line len=3]::
13413::$$$message_0109_0012_0000$$$::...The big lunch box bag by their feet looks familiar.[lr]::
13414::$$$message_0109_0012_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Wait, aren't those my shirt and jeans?[font italic=false]::
13415::$$$message_0109_0013_0000$$$::"Ah, how close! You should cut your way in!"[lr]::
13416::$$$message_0109_0013_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Saber? ...Yeah, there's no doubt about it.[font italic=false][lr]::
13417::$$$message_0109_0013_0002$$$::That blue ribbon. That's definitely Saber. Come to think of it, she did say that she'd try going out during the day, since it's a nice day out.[lr]::
13418::$$$message_0109_0013_0003$$$::"Yes, there you go! Wonderful! How commendable!"::
13419::$$$message_0109_0014_0000$$$::When I try to get the completely immersed Saber to notice me by standing up and waving my hand[line len=3][lr]::
13420::$$$message_0109_0014_0001$$$::One of the children leaves the game and goes towards Saber. The other children start to gather too.::
13421::$$$message_0109_0015_0000$$$::"Oh, are you done?"[lr]::
13422::$$$message_0109_0015_0001$$$::"Y-You're a girl...? Whatever. You're loud, Miss!"[lr]::
13423::$$$message_0109_0015_0002$$$::Being grilled by the kids, Saber looks behind her.[lr]::
13424::$$$message_0109_0015_0003$$$::"[line len=3]'Miss' is referring to me... [cacheimage storage=寸劇_セイバー03a(通常_中央)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=寸劇_セイバー03a(通常_中央)]I suppose."::
13425::$$$message_0109_0016_0000$$$::"There's no one else! We don't mind you watching, but can you be more quiet?"[lr]::
13426::$$$message_0109_0016_0001$$$::"Yeah. You're screwing us up."[lr]::
13427::$$$message_0109_0016_0002$$$::The other kids also agree.[wm canskip=0]::
13428::$$$message_0109_0017_0000$$$::"How impolite of me. I always see cheering on a large scale, so I tried to do it like that. When they score, [cacheimage storage=寸劇_セイバー02a(通常_中央)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=寸劇_セイバー02a(通常_中央)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=40 top=83 time=100 accel=2 storage=寸劇_セイバー02a(通常_中央)]they...make waves in groups, and that is a spectacular[line len=3]"[lr]::
13429::$$$message_0109_0017_0001$$$::The children's merciless stares stab into Saber, who bends and extends her knees by herself.::
13430::$$$message_0109_0018_0000$$$::"...Excuse me. I shall watch quietly from now on."[lr]::
13431::$$$message_0109_0018_0001$$$::She hangs her head low. The ball hits her knees, and Saber looks up.::
13432::$$$message_0109_0019_0000$$$::"Did you want to join us?"[lr]::
13433::$$$message_0109_0019_0001$$$::The one who threw it was the boy who was moving recklessly.[lr]::
13434::$$$message_0109_0019_0002$$$::"...Is that okay!?"[lr]::
13435::$$$message_0109_0019_0003$$$::Saber's face lights up, as she takes the ball in her hands.::
13436::$$$message_0109_0020_0000$$$::"You should quit it, Vomit."[lr]::
13437::$$$message_0109_0020_0001$$$::"Shut up!"[lr]::
13438::$$$message_0109_0020_0002$$$::"She's a foreigner."[lr]::
13439::$$$message_0109_0020_0003$$$::"Idiot. There's no teams with only Japanese people nowadays."[lr]::
13440::$$$message_0109_0020_0004$$$::"I guess that's true."[wvs][say storage=cty0209_bya_0000 name=少年Ａ]"Do you know how to play soccer?"[lr]::
13441::$$$message_0109_0020_0005$$$::"Miss, where are you from? France? Germany?"[lr]::
13442::$$$message_0109_0020_0006$$$::"I'm from England..."[lr]::
13443::$$$message_0109_0020_0007$$$::The children raise their voices in surprise.::
13444::$$$message_0109_0021_0000$$$::"Soccer is England's national sport, right? Like sumo in Japan."[lr]::
13445::$$$message_0109_0021_0001$$$::"No, it's not. It's Germany or Brazil that made it a national sport."[lr]::
13446::$$$message_0109_0021_0002$$$::"England is, you know. That hybrid between gateball and baseball. I forgot what it's called."[lr]::
13447::$$$message_0109_0021_0003$$$::"What is that? Isn't that golf?"[lr]::
13448::$$$message_0109_0021_0004$$$::"Golf is the national sport of Scotland. But England is where soccer was born."[lr]::
13449::$$$message_0109_0021_0005$$$::"Wow, you really know a lot."::
13450::$$$message_0109_0022_0000$$$::The boy that talked to Saber clicks his tongue.[lr]::
13451::$$$message_0109_0022_0001$$$::"Man, it's not Spain...?"[lr]::
13452::$$$message_0109_0022_0002$$$::"Huh...? No."[lr]::
13453::$$$message_0109_0022_0003$$$::Saber shakes her head in wonder.::
13454::$$$message_0109_0023_0000$$$::"If you're English, you must be good at soccer."[lr]::
13455::$$$message_0109_0023_0001$$$::The boy with glasses asks.[lr]::
13456::$$$message_0109_0023_0002$$$::"No, I have never tried."[lr]::
13457::$$$message_0109_0023_0003$$$::"Yeah right! You were totally watching on the edge of your seat! Does that mean that women don't play?"[lr]::
13458::$$$message_0109_0023_0004$$$::"Are you talking about 'soccah'? No..."[lr]::
13459::$$$message_0109_0023_0005$$$::Saber is staring at the ball in her hands.::
13460::$$$message_0109_0024_0000$$$::"I was always interested... But I never had the opportunity because I was training every day. However, I've seen soldiers playing often. I intend to somewhat learn the rules."::
13461::$$$message_0109_0025_0000$$$::"All you have to do is pass the ball to each other and take it to the goal that indicates enemy territory, correct?"[lr]::
13462::$$$message_0109_0025_0001$$$::"Yeah, but anyone knows that."[lr]::
13463::$$$message_0109_0025_0002$$$::"Soldiers and training... What are you, Miss? The military?"[lr]::
13464::$$$message_0109_0025_0003$$$::"Yes, something like that."[lr]::
13465::$$$message_0109_0025_0004$$$::"Oh, are you an office worker for the Self-Defense Force?"[lr]::
13466::$$$message_0109_0025_0005$$$::"Self-Defense Force?"::
13467::$$$message_0109_0026_0000$$$::"What the, I was expecting a lot from you, but you're a beginner? We're gonna get more of a burden, aren't we, Vomit?"[lr]::
13468::$$$message_0109_0026_0001$$$::"I said shut up."::
13469::$$$message_0109_0027_0000$$$::As I'm watching over from afar, the representatives of each team play rock paper scissors and seem to have decided who will take in the foreign athlete that jumped in. Saber jumps out right onto the field mingling with the kids.::
13470::$$$message_0109_0028_0000$$$::I'm relieved for now.[lr]::
13471::$$$message_0109_0028_0001$$$::I was about to go in between the circle of kids asking if they were having trouble, but I didn't have to interrupt them like that.[lr]::
13472::$$$message_0109_0028_0002$$$::I pick my chopsticks back up and resume picking at my lunch. I try acting playful and hide between the shade of a tree[line len=3]::
13473::$$$message_0109_0029_0000$$$::"Here I go, Miss!"[lr]::
13474::$$$message_0109_0029_0001$$$::"I am not 'Miss,' I am Saber!"::
13475::$$$message_0109_0030_0000$$$::Even while protesting, she sharply follows the ball that jumps up in front of her.[lr]::
13476::$$$message_0109_0030_0001$$$::"Trap it!" A boy's voice pierces through her back.[lr]::
13477::$$$message_0109_0030_0002$$$::"Huh? A trap!?"[lr]::
13478::$$$message_0109_0030_0003$$$::"Stop it with your body!"[lr]::
13479::$$$message_0109_0030_0004$$$::"I see!"::
13480::$$$message_0109_0031_0000$$$::An inconsistent play continues.[lr]::
13481::$$$message_0109_0031_0001$$$::No matter how petite Saber is, there's something off about her playing among the kids.::
13482::$$$message_0109_0032_0000$$$::But she doesn't mind that at all, and she's shining vibrantly. The kids seem to pick up on the fact that Saber's enjoying herself, so they stop going easy on her and start playing seriously.::
13483::$$$message_0109_0033_0000$$$::Saber has already become a spectacle.[lr]::
13484::$$$message_0109_0033_0001$$$::She copied the movements of the kids and became used to handling the ball in the blink of an eye.[lr]::
13485::$$$message_0109_0033_0002$$$::The way she carries herself is like a different person within a few minutes. She even easily catches balls that would have normally gone out of play, and returns them to the game.[lr]::
13486::$$$message_0109_0033_0003$$$::When that happens, the opposing team can't carelessly kick it into their safety zone and score a goal, so they're passing it little by little.::
13487::$$$message_0109_0034_0000$$$::Even so, the kid that caught my eye who seemed to be part of the local team makes full use of feints and handles Saber, who approaches him to try to steal the ball.[lr]::
13488::$$$message_0109_0034_0001$$$::He slows down his running speed abruptly and falls forward, passing towards a different direction from Saber's line of sight. She is being trifled with easily.::
13489::$$$message_0109_0035_0000$$$::But there is no second time. He pretends to shoot with all his might, but then passes the ball to his teammates on the side. Saber catches up in an agile manner.::
13490::$$$message_0109_0036_0000$$$::The ball crosses over to Saber at last. Unfortunately, the four on her side have retreated towards the back. Only Saber is in the enemy territory.[lr]::
13491::$$$message_0109_0036_0001$$$::Saber looks back to her own team, as if to ask what she should do. High-spirited voices overlap onto her back.::
13492::$$$message_0109_0037_0000$$$::"Wide open!"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_byb_0010 name=少年Ｂ]"Shoot it!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13493::$$$message_0109_0037_0001$$$::Saber's expression suddenly becomes serious.[lr]::
13494::$$$message_0109_0037_0002$$$::"Yes!"::
13495::$$$message_0109_0038_0000$$$::The opposing team had invaded so far that they visibly look shorthanded. The boy who is defender and goalkeeper runs to the goal.::
13496::$$$message_0109_0039_0000$$$::Saber approaches in front of the goal, with a dribble as if sliding on the grass. She faces the goalkeeper one-on-one.::
13497::$$$message_0109_0040_0000$$$::"Hnng!"[wvs][se storage=se526.wav][lr]::
13498::$$$message_0109_0040_0001$$$::She shoots straight at the goal without hesitation.::
13499::$$$message_0109_0041_0000$$$::Being intimidated by her spirit, the goalkeeper's body freezes.[lr]::
13500::$$$message_0109_0041_0001$$$::The ball brushes over his head, [se storage=se581.wav volume=70]and bounces high off [shock vmax=20 time=800 count=10]the bar above the goal.::
13501::$$$message_0109_0042_0000$$$::"Aw, man."[lr]::
13502::$$$message_0109_0042_0001$$$::"What a shot."[lr]::
13503::$$$message_0109_0042_0002$$$::"How scary."[lr]::
13504::$$$message_0109_0042_0003$$$::The energetic boy's surprised shout drowns out the unhappy voices.[lr]::
13505::$$$message_0109_0042_0004$$$::"Not yet! Push it in!"[lr]::
13506::$$$message_0109_0042_0005$$$::"Of course!"::
13507::$$$message_0109_0043_0000$$$::When I look up, the ball that became a black dot in the sky has been pushed back by a headwind.[lr]::
13508::$$$message_0109_0043_0001$$$::Saber sprints towards the point of the fall.[lr]::
13509::$$$message_0109_0043_0002$$$::Really it's supposed to be out if it goes out of the line even if it's in the air. But, the rules allow that here. So, the ball is not out.::
13510::$$$message_0109_0044_0000$$$::"I won't let you!"[lr]::
13511::$$$message_0109_0044_0001$$$::The opposing team who came running back as if to not let that happen surrounds Saber.[lr]::
13512::$$$message_0109_0044_0002$$$::Saber uses the reaction of her knee's bounce, shows off a jump that surpasses their height, and[line len=3][lr]::
13513::$$$message_0109_0044_0003$$$::[line len=3]grabs the ball.::
13514::$$$message_0109_0045_0000$$$::She lands, her shirt rising up. Saber holds the ball high over her head and throws it in front of the kids who are taken aback.[lr]::
13515::$$$message_0109_0045_0001$$$::The goal net sways behind the goalkeeper who stands rigidly.[lr]::
13516::$$$message_0109_0045_0002$$$::She somewhat makes a goal.::
13517::$$$message_0109_0046_0000$$$::"How is this!?"[lr]::
13518::$$$message_0109_0046_0001$$$::The kids' turned off stare pierces through Saber, who turns around with a proud pose.[lr]::
13519::$$$message_0109_0046_0002$$$::"...Oh?"::
13520::$$$message_0109_0047_0000$$$::"A-Ah[line len=3]"[lr]::
13521::$$$message_0109_0047_0001$$$::She frantically tucks in her shirt that had lifted up greatly into her pants.[lr]::
13522::$$$message_0109_0047_0002$$$::"D-Did you see? My jeans are a bit loose..."[lr]::
13523::$$$message_0109_0047_0003$$$::"T-That's not it!"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_bya_0050 name=少年Ａ]"We wouldn't look, idiot."[wvs][say storage=cty0209_byb_0030 name=少年Ｂ]"I saw."[lr]::
13524::$$$message_0109_0047_0004$$$::The kids also get influenced, blushing while holding their foreheads.::
13525::$$$message_0109_0048_0000$$$::"Are you serious, Miss!? That's football if you use your hands!"[lr]::
13526::$$$message_0109_0048_0001$$$::"Huh? What is 'football'?"[lr]::
13527::$$$message_0109_0048_0002$$$::She's flustered, getting scolded. Well, Saber is the one at fault.::
13528::$$$message_0109_0049_0000$$$::"Isn't she getting it mixed up with rugby?"[lr]::
13529::$$$message_0109_0049_0001$$$::"Rugby?"[lr]::
13530::$$$message_0109_0049_0002$$$::Saber asks with a confused look.[lr]::
13531::$$$message_0109_0049_0003$$$::"The 'soccah' that you all mentioned is football in short, correct? Are you not allowed to use your hands?"[lr]::
13532::$$$message_0109_0049_0004$$$::"Of course not!"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_meg_0040 name=メガネ]"That's a handball! That's a foul!"[lr]::
13533::$$$message_0109_0049_0005$$$::"Oh."::
13534::$$$message_0109_0050_0000$$$::"However, there are times when they throw the ball on television[line len=3]"[lr]::
13535::$$$message_0109_0050_0001$$$::"Only the goalie can use their arms! I said that he's the goalie at the very beginning."[lr]::
13536::$$$message_0109_0050_0002$$$::"Yeah, me."[lr]::
13537::$$$message_0109_0050_0003$$$::The goalie boy raises his hand again.::
13538::$$$message_0109_0051_0000$$$::"Oh... I didn't know that is what you meant.[lr]::
13539::$$$message_0109_0051_0001$$$::That was my mistake. I shall be careful from now on."[lr]::
13540::$$$message_0109_0051_0002$$$::Saber fixes her drooping head and crosses her arms in wonder.::
13541::$$$message_0109_0052_0000$$$::"Hm. The rules of Japanese 'soccah' are complicated while being simple. In my country, all we had to do was put the ball in the goal."[lr]::
13542::$$$message_0109_0052_0001$$$::"Does that mean anything goes?"[lr]::
13543::$$$message_0109_0052_0002$$$::"Yes. We kick the ball because it is the most efficient way to cover distance. We would hold the ball underneath our arms, steal it from each other, and charge through while punching each other right before the goal."::
13544::$$$message_0109_0053_0000$$$::"Punching is totally a foul, too!"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_bya_0060 name=少年Ａ]"Eject. Eject!"[lr]::
13545::$$$message_0109_0053_0001$$$::"...How about bouncing the ball off walls or trees? Is that not allowed either?"[lr]::
13546::$$$message_0109_0053_0002$$$::"There's no trees growing on the field."[lr]::
13547::$$$message_0109_0053_0003$$$::"There were more games in the town than the field."[lr]::
13548::$$$message_0109_0053_0004$$$::"Huh? The town?"[lr]::
13549::$$$message_0109_0053_0005$$$::"Are you actually British?"[lr]::
13550::$$$message_0109_0053_0006$$$::"I do not have much confidence when you ask me that."::
13551::$$$message_0109_0054_0000$$$::Hmm... What Saber was watching in admiration during the dynasty period must've been the ball game that became soccer's original form. Besides, it's about Saber. Even if it's different from what she's used to, she should get used to moving her body right away.[lr]::
13552::$$$message_0109_0054_0001$$$::What's more worrying is...::
13553::$$$message_0109_0055_0000$$$::"So, your footwork is what is most important."[lr]::
13554::$$$message_0109_0055_0001$$$::The kids look at each other half-disgusted.[lr]::
13555::$$$message_0109_0055_0002$$$::"There's heading too... But you're a girl."[lr]::
13556::$$$message_0109_0055_0003$$$::"Do girls shoot goals like that?"[lr]::
13557::$$$message_0109_0055_0004$$$::"Mrgh. Then, I shall kick seriously."[lr]::
13558::$$$message_0109_0055_0005$$$::"Guh, you weren't serious before?"::
13559::$$$message_0109_0056_0000$$$::"I was about to bump into others, so I was going easy on you all."[lr]::
13560::$$$message_0109_0056_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
13561::$$$message_0109_0056_0002$$$::The children look dubious.::
13562::$$$message_0109_0057_0000$$$::They're starting to whisper face-to-face, leaving Saber out of the circle.[lr]::
13563::$$$message_0109_0057_0001$$$::That especially energetic boy is loudly saying things like,[wvs] [say storage=cty0209_ger_0160 name=ゲロス]"Are you serious!?" [wvs][say storage=cty0209_ger_0170 name=ゲロス]"I won't do it!" or [wvs][say storage=cty0209_ger_0180 name=ゲロス]"Fine! Yeah, I'm the one that's always wrong!" What a fun guy.[lr]::
13564::$$$message_0109_0057_0002$$$::The circle unravels, and they face Saber again.::
13565::$$$message_0109_0058_0000$$$::"Okay then, Miss. Let's fight from the beginning again! How about that!?"[lr]::
13566::$$$message_0109_0058_0001$$$::"It is a match. Very well. I shall accept the challenge. [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(211,35,255)(211,64,255)(211,35,255)(211,64,255)(211,35,255)(211,64,255) storage=寸劇_セイバー02a(通常_中央) accel=0]I cannot be satisfied with only one mistake after another. More than anything, I cannot enjoy my dinner like this.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13567::$$$message_0109_0058_0002$$$::I also felt as though you all had not been going all out yet."::
13568::$$$message_0109_0059_0000$$$::There it is.[lr]::
13569::$$$message_0109_0059_0001$$$::Saber's specialty[line len=3]and also her biggest weakness: her competitive nature!::
13570::$$$message_0109_0060_0000$$$::The kids are really pale now.[lr]::
13571::$$$message_0109_0060_0001$$$::They had been dealing with quite the opponent despite her being a beginner.[lr]::
13572::$$$message_0109_0060_0002$$$::As expected of the monstrous King of Beasts. Even if her opponents are immature little kids, she doesn't go easy on them at all.::
13573::$$$message_0109_0061_0000$$$::And so, the rock paper scissors that will determine the boys' life or death starts.[lr]::
13574::$$$message_0109_0061_0001$$$::Screams echo across the field, and friends and foes are decided. As both armies distance themselves, Saber looks wonderingly.::
13575::$$$message_0109_0062_0000$$$::"The number of people are different from before. There are five people over there. Are there only four people on my team including myself?"[lr]::
13576::$$$message_0109_0062_0001$$$::"It's a handicap."[lr]::
13577::$$$message_0109_0062_0002$$$::"You're worth two people, Miss. That's why it's five versus five."[lr]::
13578::$$$message_0109_0062_0003$$$::"No it's not. It's the same whether you're here or not, Vomit."[lr]::
13579::$$$message_0109_0062_0004$$$::"...Shut up."::
13580::$$$message_0109_0063_0000$$$::Before they start the game, the children choose who will go buy drinks and express their desires. Saber's conversation continues next to them.::
13581::$$$message_0109_0064_0000$$$::"Even so, I am a beginner...[lr]::
13582::$$$message_0109_0064_0001$$$::But Vomit, I am glad that you are on my te[line len=3]"[lr]::
13583::$$$message_0109_0064_0002$$$::"Don't call me Vomit!"[lr]::
13584::$$$message_0109_0064_0003$$$::His voice echoes an exceptional amount, and the children go silent for a moment.[lr]::
13585::$$$message_0109_0064_0004$$$::But, the different drinks that are mentioned drowns out the silence.::
13586::$$$message_0109_0065_0000$$$::"Gola."[wvs canskip=0 time=400][say storage=cty0209_bya_0090 name=少年Ａ]"I want a pudding shake!"[wvs canskip=0 time=400][say storage=cty0209_byb_0050 name=少年Ｂ]"Me too."[br][wvs canskip=0 time=600][say storage=cty0209_ger_0220 name=ゲロス]"Are you serious!?"[br][wvs canskip=0 time=400][say storage=cty0209_meg_0080 name=メガネ]"Bean sprouts candy."[wvs][say storage=cty0209_byc_0000 name=少年Ｃ]"A hot Doctol Pepper."[br][wvs canskip=0 time=400][say storage=cty0209_byd_0000 name=少年Ｄ]"Chili Pepper noodles."[wvs][say storage=cty0209_bye_0000 name=少年Ｅ]"Taheebo tea."[say storage=cty0209_byf_0000 name=少年Ｆ]"Root beer."[br][wvs canskip=0 time=600][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(268,266,255)(274,293,0)(269,265,255)(275,295,0)(268,266,255)(273,298,0)(267,271,255) storage=120_寸劇歓声01 accel=0][say storage=cty0209_ger_0230 name=ゲロス]"Fine! I'll go look for them! You better drink them!"[wvs canskip=0 time=400][br][say storage=cty0209_sav_0420 name=セイバー]"I would like some tea please. In a bottle if possible."[br][wvs][say storage=cty0209_ger_0240 name=ゲロス]"I can't hold everything! Someone else come with me!"::
13587::$$$message_0109_0066_0000$$$::The boys who hold the drinks in their hands stretch their legs on the grass and take a short break.[lr]::
13588::$$$message_0109_0066_0001$$$::Saber sits straight next to the boys who sit cross-legged.[lr]::
13589::$$$message_0109_0066_0002$$$::[line len=3]She seems to be looking around.[lr]::
13590::$$$message_0109_0066_0003$$$::Unlike usual, it looks like she noticed that she's not wearing a skirt. [rep fliplr=0 tops=57,119,52,114 storages=寸劇_セイバー04a(通常_中央),寸劇_絆創膏少年04a(通常_左),寸劇_茶髪少年01a(通常_中央),寸劇_眼鏡少年01a(通常_右) time=300 flipud=0 lefts=114,-18,268,433 bg=fd16ex_サッカー寸劇c2 indexes=1000,2000,3000,4000]She looks around carefully and nervously tries sitting cross-legged.::
13591::$$$message_0109_0067_0000$$$::...I wonder what's up with that satisfied expression.[lr]::
13592::$$$message_0109_0067_0001$$$::I pull my head into the shadow of the tree and feel a slight sense of loss.[lr]::
13593::$$$message_0109_0067_0002$$$::[line len=3]Just kidding, I was desperately trying to hold back my laughter.::
13594::$$$message_0109_0068_0000$$$::Saber talks to the boy energetically.[lr]::
13595::$$$message_0109_0068_0001$$$::"It seems like that was not a good nickname from earlier. I apologize for calling you that so familiarly.[lr]::
13596::$$$message_0109_0068_0002$$$::...However, are you okay as things stand?"[lr]::
13597::$$$message_0109_0068_0003$$$::"I'm not mad or anything. Sorry for raising my voice."::
13598::$$$message_0109_0069_0000$$$::Another boy lays flat on his stomach on the grass.[lr]::
13599::$$$message_0109_0069_0001$$$::"This guy is good at being a goalie since he's not afraid of the ball."[lr]::
13600::$$$message_0109_0069_0002$$$::"That is wonderful."[lr]::
13601::$$$message_0109_0069_0003$$$::"I want to shoot goals! As a forward!"[lr]::
13602::$$$message_0109_0069_0004$$$::"You haven't gotten a single point though."[lr]::
13603::$$$message_0109_0069_0005$$$::"...Hrrk..."::
13604::$$$message_0109_0070_0000$$$::"So, when was it exactly? You took a shot straight to your stomach from this close. And then you yakked."[lr]::
13605::$$$message_0109_0070_0001$$$::"I see. So that is why you were called Vo[line len=2]that."[lr]::
13606::$$$message_0109_0070_0002$$$::"Yeah. That's it."[lr]::
13607::$$$message_0109_0070_0003$$$::"..."::
13608::$$$message_0109_0071_0000$$$::"That is nothing to be embarrassed about. That is a wound of honor."[lr]::
13609::$$$message_0109_0071_0001$$$::"You can't get a foul from an opponent just from throwing up."::
13610::$$$message_0109_0072_0000$$$::"Huh? What was your original name again? You were talking about it before, right? Was it Vomiston?"[lr]::
13611::$$$message_0109_0072_0001$$$::"Wasn't it Gullickson?"[lr]::
13612::$$$message_0109_0072_0002$$$::"...No."::
13613::$$$message_0109_0073_0000$$$::The boy scratches his head and says.[lr]::
13614::$$$message_0109_0073_0001$$$::"There's an athlete that can shoot insane goals in La Liga in Spain.[lr]::
13615::$$$message_0109_0073_0002$$$::His name was Tristán[line len=3]"[lr]::
13616::$$$message_0109_0073_0003$$$::"Oh yeah, that's it."[lr]::
13617::$$$message_0109_0073_0004$$$::Saber opens her eyes at that moment and stares fixedly at the boy.::
13618::$$$message_0109_0074_0000$$$::"W-What? Don't get so close to me."[lr]::
13619::$$$message_0109_0074_0001$$$::"Tristán."[lr]::
13620::$$$message_0109_0074_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
13621::$$$message_0109_0074_0003$$$::"Are you Tristán?"[lr]::
13622::$$$message_0109_0074_0004$$$::"Vomit is fine. Stop it, that's embarrassing."::
13623::$$$message_0109_0075_0000$$$::"It is a wonderful name.[lr]::
13624::$$$message_0109_0075_0001$$$::Tristán. Please let me call you that."[lr]::
13625::$$$message_0109_0075_0002$$$::"I-It's not my real name or anything. It would trouble Tristán if I'm this weak at soccer."::
13626::$$$message_0109_0076_0000$$$::Saber puts her hand on her chest and speaks.[lr]::
13627::$$$message_0109_0076_0001$$$::"That is not true.[lr]::
13628::$$$message_0109_0076_0002$$$::Being admired by a boy like you would be the best encouragement for one going to battle in any generation."[lr]::
13629::$$$message_0109_0076_0003$$$::The Tristán boy turns red even while being flustered.::
13630::$$$message_0109_0077_0000$$$::"So what if you cannot get one point? You will be able to right away. Let us try our best. [wm canskip=0]With the four of us."[lr]::
13631::$$$message_0109_0077_0001$$$::Saber takes the initiative in standing up.::
13632::$$$message_0109_0078_0000$$$::"At any rate, the score will turn into something like 'seventy-seven versus eighty-eight' in the end. There will be chances for each athlete to score one point[line len=3]"[lr]::
13633::$$$message_0109_0078_0001$$$::"That's basketball, Miss."[lr]::
13634::$$$message_0109_0078_0002$$$::"There aren't any three-point field goals either."[lr]::
13635::$$$message_0109_0078_0003$$$::"What a weird foreigner."[lr]::
13636::$$$message_0109_0078_0004$$$::"Mrgh."::
13637::$$$message_0109_0079_0000$$$::[line len=3]The game starts.[lr]::
13638::$$$message_0109_0079_0001$$$::Saber pesters the Tristán boy to go towards the front just beforehand.[lr]::
13639::$$$message_0109_0079_0002$$$::"If you're planning to win, then you need to go in the front. I have to be the goalie."[lr]::
13640::$$$message_0109_0079_0003$$$::He asserts and doesn't back down at all.::
13641::$$$message_0109_0080_0000$$$::Saber's side is inferior in numbers. It's three versus four excluding the goalkeeper from both sides. The difference of one person in a game with so few people was far more difficult than expected and showed in battle.::
13642::$$$message_0109_0081_0000$$$::Once they got ahold of the ball, the strategy was basically attacking by passing the ball between Saber and another person.[lr]::
13643::$$$message_0109_0081_0001$$$::But the defender role that is supposed to support the two in the front is one person. Only one person. How undependable.[lr]::
13644::$$$message_0109_0081_0002$$$::On the other hand, in addition to the one defender, the opposite side has another person left that acts as a midfielder that can maneuver between both offense and defense. They are actually operating like a soccer team.::
13645::$$$message_0109_0082_0000$$$::It seems like the children aren't thinking about the offside rules. Then, it should be advantageous to Saber who can go deep into enemy territory with her leg strength. Or it would be.::
13646::$$$message_0109_0083_0000$$$::However, the passes are often interrupted, and everyone has to go on the defensive as the offensive is destroyed right away. Saber and the others are stuck to their own side and can't move at all.::
13647::$$$message_0109_0084_0000$$$::Words of encouragement are shouted from the goal to Saber and the others. However, the goalkeeper boy himself mostly can't even go out into the front himself. But he still raises his voice as much as he can and points to a place that is easy to attack.::
13648::$$$message_0109_0085_0000$$$::A chance arrives. Saber in the front catches the ball that her teammate clears. She goes into a dribble without skipping a beat.[lr]::
13649::$$$message_0109_0085_0001$$$::There is a world of difference from her earlier movements. Neither her teammate nor her enemies would be able to catch up. Yes. In order to go against a large number of opponents, she can only move enough to equal two Sabers.::
13650::$$$message_0109_0086_0000$$$::The opposing defense stands in her way.[lr]::
13651::$$$message_0109_0086_0001$$$::Saber who slows down pretends to return the ball to her teammate on the other side towards the back, turns around once, and starts sprinting right away again.[lr]::
13652::$$$message_0109_0086_0002$$$::It's a feint. The opponent that fell right into it was left behind on the field. How good. The only opponent left is the goalkeeper.::
13653::$$$message_0109_0087_0000$$$::"That's our chance!"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_byb_0060 name=少年Ｂ]"We have our first goal!"[lr]::
13654::$$$message_0109_0087_0001$$$::Her teammates cheer. Saber nods, not stopping her feet. The opposing goalkeeper also saw Saber's goal from earlier. His heart must be in his mouth seeing the approaching lion that is letting out a roar.::
13655::$$$message_0109_0088_0000$$$::"I will not miss anymore."[lr]::
13656::$$$message_0109_0088_0001$$$::She goes into a shooting position from a place farther than last time. It must be a sign of her confidence. Either that, or it's out of mercy to give time for the goalkeeper to run away.::
13657::$$$message_0109_0089_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Hnng!"[lr]::
13658::$$$message_0109_0089_0001$$$::Her leg that's pulled back like a bow flashes.[lr]::
13659::$$$message_0109_0089_0002$$$::A dry sound like a gunshot echoes across the field. My cheeks are trembling.[lr]::
13660::$$$message_0109_0089_0003$$$::"Wo...ah."[stopquake][lr]::
13661::$$$message_0109_0089_0004$$$::The children cover their ears and are frozen in place from astonishment.::
13662::$$$message_0109_0090_0000$$$::[font italic=true][line len=3]Did she surpass the speed of sound?[font italic=false][lr]::
13663::$$$message_0109_0090_0001$$$::When she said kicking seriously[line len=3]she seriously meant it.[lr]::
13664::$$$message_0109_0090_0002$$$::O-Of course. It's Saber, haha...[lr]::
13665::$$$message_0109_0090_0003$$$::At this point, I check the goal with the worst-case scenario in mind.::
13666::$$$message_0109_0091_0000$$$::A child who was disassembled into molecular units and covered in red...isn't there. The boy who is crouching in the corner of the goalpost finally opens his eyes.[lr]::
13667::$$$message_0109_0091_0001$$$::There is no ball in the net, and there aren't any big holes either. It's just swaying in the breeze.::
13668::$$$message_0109_0092_0000$$$::"Wow, that was like a movie!"[lr]::
13669::$$$message_0109_0092_0001$$$::"The goalie died!"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_cha_0280 name=チャパツ]"I didn't die!"[lr]::
13670::$$$message_0109_0092_0002$$$::"So, where's the ball!?"[lr]::
13671::$$$message_0109_0092_0003$$$::The excited students gather towards Saber. Saber points at the sky with a shameful expression.[lr]::
13672::$$$message_0109_0092_0004$$$::"...I apologize."::
13673::$$$message_0109_0093_0000$$$::"What!!!"[lr]::
13674::$$$message_0109_0093_0001$$$::The kids' shrieks and angry roars echo throughout the autumn sky.[lr]::
13675::$$$message_0109_0093_0002$$$::The poor ball is split greatly into the shape of a three-leaf clover and is rotating like a boomerang or an unidentified flying object.::
13676::$$$message_0109_0094_0000$$$::"Oh man, she popped Saegusa's ball!"[lr]::
13677::$$$message_0109_0094_0001$$$::"Eek! She's gonna kill us!"[lr]::
13678::$$$message_0109_0094_0002$$$::"Not my fault! You're the only one that's gonna get yelled at, Kota!"[lr]::
13679::$$$message_0109_0094_0003$$$::"What are we gonna do about the game?"[lr]::
13680::$$$message_0109_0094_0004$$$::"Woah, do it again please."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13681::$$$message_0109_0094_0005$$$::"There aren't any more balls!"[lr]::
13682::$$$message_0109_0094_0006$$$::...Saber is hanging her head in disappointment.::
13683::$$$message_0109_0095_0000$$$::As I'm taken aback, the ball falls into a bush near me.[lr]::
13684::$$$message_0109_0095_0001$$$::A burn mark is going in a straight line on the synthetic leather that was torn greatly from being exposed to the shock of the shot. It's a witness that took Saber's powerful blow.::
13685::$$$message_0109_0096_0000$$$::...[lr]::
13686::$$$message_0109_0096_0001$$$::I hesitate for a moment.[lr]::
13687::$$$message_0109_0096_0002$$$::I don't know whether I should stay and watch the game until the end or leave before she finds me.[lr]::
13688::$$$message_0109_0096_0003$$$::If I want to watch until the end, then I should watch over how things turn out[line len=3][lr]::
13689::$$$message_0109_0096_0004$$$::"...I can only choose one or the other when it comes to things like this."[lr]::
13690::$$$message_0109_0096_0005$$$::I'm reluctant to leave, but I can only do this much. Trace, on.::
13691::$$$message_0109_0097_0000$$$::Among the children who gather in memory of the lost ball as if they are holding a wake, the Tristán boy is the only one who's still full of energy.::
13692::$$$message_0109_0098_0000$$$::"What, it's just a ball!"[lr]::
13693::$$$message_0109_0098_0001$$$::"But, Saegusa won't have an allowance for a while."[lr]::
13694::$$$message_0109_0098_0002$$$::"No...way, g-give that up."[lr]::
13695::$$$message_0109_0098_0003$$$::"I shall compensate[line len=3]"[lr]::
13696::$$$message_0109_0098_0004$$$::"That's not possible. She wouldn't accept money from others."[lr]::
13697::$$$message_0109_0098_0005$$$::"That is unfortunate..."::
13698::$$$message_0109_0099_0000$$$::"Then you should get yours, Vomit. You live nearby, right?"[lr]::
13699::$$$message_0109_0099_0001$$$::"M-My ball got kicked into the river."[lr]::
13700::$$$message_0109_0099_0002$$$::"Oh. The one from the last penalty shootout."[lr]::
13701::$$$message_0109_0099_0003$$$::"I've never seen a shot that went so far in a penalty shootout."[lr]::
13702::$$$message_0109_0099_0004$$$::"Shut up, I'll grow up and get it back some day!"[lr]::
13703::$$$message_0109_0099_0005$$$::"I am truly ashamed of myself..."::
13704::$$$message_0109_0100_0000$$$::The soccer ball comes back all of a sudden into the children's circle. [move opacity=255 storage=119_寸劇ボール cx=73 py=-11 px=742 affine=(625,46,47.49,1,255,73,74)(520,143,139.399,1,255,73,74)(408,401,199.093,1,255,73,74) time=500 cy=74 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=0 spline=1][wm canskip=0][se storage=se686.wav][move time=150 path=(340,300,255)(340,320,255) storage=119_寸劇ボール accel=0][wm canskip=0]It bounces high on the grass before landing squarely in Saber's hand. [chgfg time=300 storage=寸劇_セイバー02a(通常_中央)][move spread=1 mx=368 magnify=1 time=100 my=266 path=(368,260,255,1.174)(368,267,255,1) storage=寸劇_セイバー02a(通常_中央) accel=0][wm canskip=0]Although the burn mark is still slightly there, it's a ball full of air.::
13705::$$$message_0109_0101_0000$$$::"Wait, what!?"[wvs][say storage=cty0209_byb_0100 name=少年Ｂ]"Where did it come from?"[lr]::
13706::$$$message_0109_0101_0001$$$::Even if they were to look around now, I'm laying around in the shadow of the bushes. The kids peek into Saber's arms intently.::
13707::$$$message_0109_0102_0000$$$::"It's fixed..."[wvs][say storage=cty0209_bya_0150 name=少年Ａ]"How scary."[lr]::
13708::$$$message_0109_0102_0001$$$::"That's a surprise! Miss, are you a magician!?"[lr]::
13709::$$$message_0109_0102_0002$$$::"N-No. I am not good at magecraft."[lr]::
13710::$$$message_0109_0102_0003$$$::"See, it came back! See!?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
13711::$$$message_0109_0102_0004$$$::"It's alive? Or should I say it got revived?"[lr]::
13712::$$$message_0109_0102_0005$$$::"This is..."[lr]::
13713::$$$message_0109_0102_0006$$$::"Yes. It must be magic."[lr]::
13714::$$$message_0109_0102_0007$$$::Saber holds onto the ball carefully.::
13715::$$$message_0109_0103_0000$$$::"...All right."[lr]::
13716::$$$message_0109_0103_0001$$$::It seems like she found out that I was taking a peek, so I should retreat soon.[lr]::
13717::$$$message_0109_0103_0002$$$::Saber seems to genuinely be having fun playing soccer with the children. That would be ruined if she made eye contact with me.::
13718::$$$message_0109_0104_0000$$$::"I'll ask her what the result of the game was like next time."[lr]::
13719::$$$message_0109_0104_0001$$$::I sneakily distance myself from the field.[lr]::
13720::$$$message_0109_0104_0002$$$::Now[line len=3]I wonder where I should go in the afternoon...:␀��